; XAUUSD v3: single trade only (MaxGridLevels=1) — isolate MA cross signal quality
; If RF passes with no grid, the signal has edge and we need to fix the grid spacing
; ATRmult=3.0 was best in v2
InpExitMode=2||2||0||3||N
InpMaxGridLevels=1||1||0||1||N
InpSL_ATRmult=3.0||3.0||0||3.0||N
InpCloseAllWhenDDPct=50||50||0||50||N
InpFastMA=20||10||5||35||Y
InpSlowMA=50||40||10||120||Y
